example:
同一次提交写下支付结果和待发记录：

```java
@Transactional
public void markPaid(String paymentId, String orderId) {
  payment.markPaid(paymentId);
  outbox.insert(paymentId, "PaymentPaid", orderId);
}
```

```sql
BEGIN;
UPDATE payment
   SET status = 'PAID'
 WHERE id = ? AND status = 'PAYING';
INSERT INTO outbox(id, type, payload, status)
VALUES (?, 'PaymentPaid', ?, 'NEW');
COMMIT;
```

中继读到 `NEW` 才发送，发送成功再把这行改成已投递。订单消费方按 `paymentId` 更新，第二次更新影响行数为 0。
